// HOME SCREEN — curated at-a-glance dashboard
// Shows only: Live Cameras, Chamber A/B, Thrust 1/2, Impeller 1/2, Brush 1/2,
// Pump, and the cleaning statistics (Water Used, Area Cleaned, Energy Consumed).
